@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava korisnice Ana (fototip II, MED 30, posle analize iz 02-fc1-acne.http)
# @name ana
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "ana@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Sunce pre 5 dana: UV 7, 60 min, bez SPF daje 63 mJ/cm2, više od pola MED, upozorenje
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -5 d}}", "uvIndex": 7, "minutesInSun": 60, "sunscreenSpf": 0}

### Sunce pre 4 dana sa SPF 50: doza 1.3 mJ/cm2, nema upozorenja
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -4 d}}", "uvIndex": 7, "minutesInSun": 60, "sunscreenSpf": 50}

### Sunce pre 4 dana, popodne bez SPF: drugo upozorenje
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -4 d}}", "uvIndex": 6, "minutesInSun": 70, "sunscreenSpf": 0}

### Sunce pre 3 dana: treće upozorenje
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -3 d}}", "uvIndex": 8, "minutesInSun": 45, "sunscreenSpf": 0}

### Sunce pre 2 dana: četvrto upozorenje, a UV 9 bez kreme daje i upozorenje za vrlo visok UV
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -2 d}}", "uvIndex": 9, "minutesInSun": 40, "sunscreenSpf": 0}

### CEP primer 2: peto upozorenje u 30 dana daje rizik fotostarenja i preporuku vitamin C 15% + tretinoin 0.025%
POST {{host}}/api/diary/sun
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"occurredAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}", "uvIndex": 7, "minutesInSun": 50, "sunscreenSpf": 0}

### CEP preporuke: tretinoin čeka dermatologa
GET {{host}}/api/cep/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{ana.response.body.token}}

### Prijava korisnice Milica (trudna)
# @name milica
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "milica@dermawise.rs", "password": "user123"}

### Brže punjenje dnevnika (samo dev profil): nedelja flushinga i sunca, tretinoin odmah povučen kroz safety.drl zbog trudnoće
POST {{host}}/api/demo/cep-week
Authorization: Bearer {{milica.response.body.token}}

### CEP preporuke za trudnicu: tretinoin WITHDRAWN, azelainska kiselina umesto njega
GET {{host}}/api/cep/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{milica.response.body.token}}
